mission "A Good Name for a Bad Ship"
    category "side"
    name "A Good Name for a Bad Ship"
    description "Carry the papers needed to register a refitted coaster at Port de Lune."
    source "Crown's Fall"
    destination "Port de Lune"
    reward 390
    speaker offer "Shipwright Benoit"
    speaker visit "Clerk Mireille"
    speaker complete "Clerk Mireille"
    on offer
        conversation
            `Shipwright Benoit slides a bundle of papers across his bench. "This little coaster has been rebuilt from keel to mast, but the registry still calls her a wreck. Until that is corrected, the owner cannot insure her or hire a crew."`
            `"The clerk at Port de Lune has the other half of the file. I could send a boy, but the boy would spend the fare on sweet cakes. Will you take it?"`
            choice
                `"I'll carry the papers. Every ship deserves a fair record."`
                    accept
                `"I do not fancy carrying paperwork across the sea."`
                    close
    on accept
        log "Accepted A Good Name for a Bad Ship. Deliver Benoit's registration papers to Clerk Mireille in Port de Lune."
    on visit
        conversation
            `Clerk Mireille compares the papers, checks a seal, and smiles. "There. The Sea Finch is a ship again, not a floating argument. Tell Benoit his work has been recognised."`
    on complete
        conversation
            `The clerk pays you from the registration fee. "It is good to see a captain carry papers as carefully as cannon. Both have their uses."`
